  "benefits": "\n- The project cost is ₹150,00,000/-\n\n****   **Subsidy Distribution:**\n\n1. A 40% subsidy is available for the General Category.\n1. A 60% subsidy is offered for SC (Scheduled Caste) and Women beneficiaries.\n\n",
