      "en": {
        "documentsRequired_md": "\n1. Date of Birth Proof (Voter ID, Aadhaar, Matriculation Certificate)\n1. Caste Certificate (SC/Women applicants – issued by Tehsildar/SDM)\n1. Agreement Deed with Fisheries Department\n1. Training Certificate in cold storage/ice plant operations\n1. Land Records (Jamabandi, Fard, Registered Patta with clear title)\n1. GST Bills for construction/equipment\n1. Photographs of cold storage with beneficiary\n1. Bank Account Details and PAN Card\n1. DPR/SCP as per PMMSY\n1. CA Certificate for GST/IT compliance of bills\n1. Bills &gt; ₹50,000 must follow GST/IT/e-way bill norms\n1. Clearance Certificates – CLU/NOC/Fire/Pollution (as applicable)\n1. NOC from local authorities (Gram Sabha/Municipality)\n1. Site Plan/Area Layout Plan\n\n",
